        "content": "<p>philipc opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14519\">PR #14519</a> from <code>philipc:object-symbol-flags</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The default symbol flags depend on whether the symbol has been defined or not. Calling symbol_flags_mut() initialises the flags with the default, so calling it before add_symbol_data() results in the wrong flags.</p>\n<p>See <a href=\"https://github.com/gimli-rs/object/issues/1002\">https://github.com/gimli-rs/object/issues/1002</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
